# The killer's party loses its alliances (KetraOrcSupport onMyDying, testKetraDemote): Leader (Ketra 5,
# level 5 badge), Mate (Ketra 2, level 2 badge) and Third (Varka 3, level 3 Varka badge) are one party;
# Leader kills a Ketra footman. Leader and Mate lose the alliance, each badge going down a level; Third
# keeps the Varka alliance and its badge. Not traced: the reference probe plays no member line.
character Leader 40
standing 5
hold 7215 1
member Mate 40 standing 2 hold 7212 1
member Third 40 standing -3 hold 7223 1
item 7211 7212 7214 7215 7222 7223
script script.feature.KetraOrcSupport
script script.feature.VarkaSilenosSupport
npc footman 21324 Monster 40 0 0

kill footman
  S SystemMessage id=302 3:7215
  S SystemMessage id=54 3:7214
  standing player 0
  standing Mate 0
  standing Third -3
  items 7215=0 7214=1
  items Mate 7212=0 7211=1
  items Third 7223=1 7222=0
